<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Guidant Corp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1998 earnings estimate to $3.30 a share from $3.08 a share.  Said earnings increase reflects expectations of higher sales and increased angioplasty business.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $82-$85 a share.</p>
<p>-- Guidant gained 3/4 to 70 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
